+
+So your modified `ec_algorithm.py` MUST still provide:
+- A class named `DEOptimizer` (you can also add other classes)
+- Constructor: `__init__(self, dim, lower_bounds, upper_bounds, max_evals, params=None, controller=None, recorder=None, swarm_size=None)`
